What it tells us
The failure directly weakens the hypothesis that telomerase inhibition produc=
es disease-modifying survival benefit in advanced myelofibrosis. Imetelstat r=
emains clinically validated for transfusion independence in lower-risk MDS, b=
ut that is a narrower value proposition than a hematology franchise spanning =
anemia control and survival extension. (
FDA,
FDA approves imetelstat for lower-risk MDS with transfusion-dependent anemia
, June 6, 2024
)
What to watch next
The full IMpactMF dataset, particularly subgroup and exposure analyses, and w=
hether Geron retains further myelofibrosis development or concentrates capita=
l on Rytelo commercialization.
