 more than double the weight loss of Ozempic=E2=80=99s highest approved dose<=
/em>, October 28, 2026</a>)</li>
<li style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-hei=
ght:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 6px;">FDA proposed allowing multiple patient=
-specific genome-editing variants under one BLA, while CMS moved to extend it=
s Medicaid outcomes-based purchasing model beyond sickle cell disease. (<a hr=
